abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and de-identified derived data for a study of how the
  joints of one body co-modulate in amplitude during spontaneous face-to-face
  conversation. The deposit contains the conditioned joint-angle series of 70
  participants at 15 Hz, the cross-wavelet and wavelet-coherence matrices
  derived from them, the circular-shift surrogate null, the anthropometric
  vectors, and scripts that recompute every quantity reported in the
  accompanying article, including the surrogate, coherence, shared-landmark
  and anthropometry controls. An interactive playback visualizer is included.
